{'symbol': 'FDS', 'date': '2019-11-14 22:30:00', 'title': 'FACTSET RESEARCH SYSTEMS INC. DECLARES QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND, PAYABLE ON DECEMBER 19, 2019', 'text': 'FACTSET RESEARCH SYSTEMS INC. ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS APPROVED A REGULAR QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.72 PER SHARE. THE CASH DIVIDEND WILL BE PAID ON DECEMBER 19, 2019 TO HOLDERS OF RECORD OF FACTSET’S COMMON STOCK AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON NOVEMBER 29, 2019.'}